 Policía Nacional","url":"https://ayuntamientovillabisono.gob.do/transparencia/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/OSC_IE_018_Boletn_Anual_2015.pdf","licence":"no licence stated","years":"2014, 2015","notes":"The bulletin is an official OSC-RD publication, but the only copy found online is on the transparency portal of the Ayuntamiento de Villa Bisonó (a municipal government site). Table marked \"Datos preliminares\". Extracted with pdftotext -layout; 2015 provinces sum to the printed Total general (1,675), but 2014 provinces sum to 1,822 against a printed total of 1,813. The \"Diferencia\" column also disagrees for María Trinidad Sánchez (32 -> 14 printed as -9, which would fit a 2014 value of 23) and El Seibo (18 -> 15 printed as -4), so at least one 2014 value is likely misprinted; values are kept exactly as printed. The Diferencia column is not copied."}},"dict":{"b":["Total"],"m":["Homicides (Policía Nacional data, preliminary)"],"u":["count"],"s":["osc2015"],"c":["2014","2015"]},"problems":"Name matches: El Seibo = geoBoundaries \"El Seybo\"; Hermanas Mirabal = \"Hermanas\"; Elías Piña = \"La Estrelleta\" (former name); Montecristi = \"Monte Cristi\".","unmatched":0,"shapes":{"shapes_ADM1.geojson":{"source":"geoBoundaries gbOpen DOM ADM1","url":"https://github.com/wmgeolab/geoBoundaries/raw/9469f09/releaseData/gbOpen/DOM/ADM1/geoBoundaries-DOM-ADM1_simplified.geojson","licence":"Public Domain","boundary_source":"Natural Earth","year":"2022"}}}